{
  "_comment": [
    "SPECIFICATION of canonical_list_url: the one spelling of a crowd-list URL the store",
    "keys list_decision, list_attempt and collection.url on. Each case is a raw URL and",
    "the canonical URL it must give, or null for text that names no MDBList or",
    "Letterboxd list. `plexdb list-decide` and the list harvests compute it in Python",
    "(tests/test_list_decisions.py) and `fold-list-decisions` in Rust",
    "(crates/plexdb/src/list_decisions.rs); both run every case here."
  ],
